      <section id="features" class="section features-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR YOUR EVERYDAY</span><h2>把复杂的运营，变得有条不紊</h2><p>环境、网络、账号与团队，在同一个地方管理。</p></div><div class="feature-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="产品功能"><button v-for="(feature, index) in features" :id="`feature-tab-${index}`" :key="feature.short" role="tab" :aria-selected="activeFeature === index" :tabindex="activeFeature === index ? 0 : -1" aria-controls="feature-panel" @click="activeFeature = index" @keydown.right.prevent="moveFeature(index + 1)" @keydown.left.prevent="moveFeature(index - 1)"><Icon :name="feature.icon" :size="21" />{{ feature.short }}</button></div><div id="feature-panel" class="feature-showcase" role="tabpanel" :aria-labelledby="`feature-tab-${activeFeature}`"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="feature-number">0{{ activeFeature + 1 }} <span>/ WORKSPACE</span></span><h3>{{ features[activeFeature].title }}</h3><p>{{ features[activeFeature].text }}</p><ul><li v-for="bullet in features[activeFeature].bullets" :key="bullet"><Icon name="check" :size="17" />{{ bullet }}</li></ul><button class="text-button" @click="open('register')">开启你的工作空间 <Icon name="arrow" :size="17" /></button></div><div class="feature-visual"><ProductPreview compact :mode="activeFeature" /><span class="feature-visual-label"><Icon :name="features[activeFeature].icon" :size="16" />{{ features[activeFeature].short }}</span></div></div></div></section>

