      <section class="container help-content"><div class="help-intro"><h2>新手入门</h2><p>从这里开始，熟悉你的工作空间。</p></div><div class="guide-grid"><button v-for="(guide, i) in guides" :key="guide.title" class="guide-card" :aria-expanded="guideIndex === i" aria-controls="guide-detail" @click="guideIndex = guideIndex === i ? null : i"><span class="card-icon" :class="['', 'mint', 'lavender', 'sand'][i]"><Icon :name="guide.icon" :size="24" /></span><h3>{{ guide.title }}</h3><p>{{ guide.detail }}</p><span class="guide-link">阅读指南<Icon name="arrow" :size="17" /></span></button></div><div v-if="guideIndex !== null" id="guide-detail" class="guide-detail"><div><h3>{{ guides[guideIndex].title }}</h3><button class="icon-button" aria-label="收起指南" @click="guideIndex = null"><Icon name="close" /></button></div><ol><li v-for="step in guides[guideIndex].steps" :key="step">{{ step }}</li></ol></div>
        <div class="help-questions"><div class="help-intro"><h2>常见问题</h2><p>关于产品，你可能还想了解这些。</p></div><div class="help-faq-layout"><aside class="faq-categories" aria-label="常见问题分类"><button v-for="item in categories" :key="item" :class="{ active: category === item }" :aria-pressed="category === item" @click="category = item">{{ item }}<Icon name="chevron" :size="15" /></button><div class="category-contact"><Icon name="message" :size="25" /><b>还没找到答案？</b><p>我们愿意听听你的问题。</p><button class="text-button" @click="open('contact')">联系支持<Icon name="arrow" :size="15" /></button></div></aside><div class="help-faq-results"><div class="results-heading"><h3>{{ query ? `“${query}”的搜索结果` : category }}</h3><span role="status">{{ filteredFaqs.length }} 个问题</span><button v-if="query || category !== '全部问题'" class="text-button" @click="query = ''; category = '全部问题'">重置筛选</button></div><div v-if="!filteredFaqs.length" class="empty-state"><Icon name="search" :size="36" /><h3>暂时没有找到相关问题</h3><p>试试其他关键词，或直接联系微信支持。</p><button class="button secondary" @click="open('contact')">联系我们</button></div><details v-for="faq in filteredFaqs" :key="faq.q" class="help-faq-item"><summary>{{ faq.q }}<Icon name="down" :size="17" /></summary><p>{{ faq.a }}</p></details></div></div></div>
        <div class="help-download"><span class="card-icon"><Icon name="download" :size="26" /></span><div><h3>正在寻找客户端？</h3><p>在下载中心了解 Windows 版本与发布进展。</p></div><button class="button primary" @click="open('download')">前往下载中心<Icon name="arrow" :size="17" /></button></div>
      </section>
